 "summary": "No existing Mathlib or Tau Ceti declaration glues finite-rank cores along a morphism or inverts operator families on a manifold over a subfield (closest are `ContMDiffWithinAt.clm_bundle_inverse`, same-field Hom-bundle form, and `ContDiffWithinAt.clm_inverse`, normed-space form). The PR reuses `CoordinateHom.invOfIsInvertible`, `operator_isInvertible_iff`, `continuousOn_inChartCoordinates`, `clm_inverse_of_eventually_isInvertible`, `IsInvertible.contDiffAt_map_inverse` and `piCongrLeft`/`finCongr` wherever they apply.",
